+
+    // The content blocker that ships with the browser. Upstream builds this
+    // provider on every platform but Windows, where the registry above was the
+    // only external source; that leaves nowhere for a bundled extension to be
+    // declared. DIR_EXTERNAL_EXTENSIONS sits beside chrome.dll under Program
